    mg_ch('4. Aggregation, Transactions & Distributed Scale', 'Aggregation Pipeline Mastery: $match, $group, $lookup, $unwind & $facet', 'mongodb aggregation pipeline, $match $group $project, $lookup join, $facet pagination',
        'MongoDB\'s **Aggregation Pipeline** processes documents through sequential server-side transformation stages—capable of filtering, joining (`$lookup`), array flattening (`$unwind`), grouping, bucketing, and window analytics in one round-trip.',
        ['**Always Place `$match` & `$sort` First**: Only `$match` and `$sort` placed at the **very beginning** of the pipeline can leverage collection B-Tree indexes!', '**`$unwind` Empty Array Trap**: By default, `$unwind: "$items"` **drops** documents where `items` is `[]` or `null`! Pass `{ path: "$items", preserveNullAndEmptyArrays: true }` for `LEFT JOIN` behavior!', '**`$facet`**: Runs multiple sub-pipelines (e.g., paginated `data` + `totalCount` + `priceBuckets`) in a single query!'],
        [['`$match` (Stage 1)', 'Filters documents using B-Tree/Text/Geo indexes', 'Reduces document volume before heavy `$lookup` or `$group` stages!'], ['`$lookup`', 'Left outer join to another collection in same DB', 'Ensure the `foreignField` in the joined collection is **indexed**!'], ['`$unwind`', 'Deconstructs an array into 1 doc per element', 'Add `preserveNullAndEmptyArrays: true` to retain empty parents.']],
        "db.products.aggregate([\n  { \$match: { stock: { \$gt: 0 } } },\n  { \$group: { _id: '\$category', productCount: { \$sum: 1 }, avgPrice: { \$avg: '\$price' } } }\n])",
