    mg_ch('4. Aggregation, Transactions & Distributed Scale', 'Text Search Indexes, Geospatial (2dsphere) Queries & $near Proximity', 'mongodb text index $text $search, 2dsphere geojson, $near $geoWithin mongodb',
        'MongoDB natively supports stemmed **Full-Text Search** (`$text`) and spherical **Geospatial Indexing (`2dsphere`)** for ride-sharing, delivery radiuses (`$near`, `$geoWithin`), and store locators using **GeoJSON**.',
        ['**CRITICAL GeoJSON Coordinate Order (`[longitude, latitude]`, NOT `[lat, lng]`!)**: Unlike Google Maps UI (`lat, lng`), **GeoJSON and MongoDB ALWAYS store `[longitude, latitude]` (`[X, Y]`)**! Swapping `[19.0760, 72.8777]` (Mumbai) puts your pin in the middle of the Indian Ocean or Antarctica (and latitude > 90 throws an out-of-bounds GeoJSON error)!', '**One Text Index Per Collection**: A collection can have **at most ONE** `text` index (though that single compound text index can cover multiple string fields with custom field `weights`!).'],
